## What this license is not

Nothing in this repository is legal advice. The contract templates, clause
language, compliance checklists and regulatory summaries are starting points
written by a practitioner, not by a lawyer. Every legal artifact here must be
reviewed by qualified counsel in the relevant jurisdiction before it is used in
a real engagement. Regulatory dates and obligations change. Verify against the
primary source before relying on any date printed in this repository.
